# Comment why and what

When adding or changing code, write a **brief** comment on each new type, member, and non-obvious block:

- **Why** it is there (the reason / problem it solves)
- **What** it does (the behavior)

Do not narrate every line. Keep existing user comments. Skip comments on trivial one-line wrappers unless the mapping is not obvious.
